# Machine-local path configuration. Copy to local.env and edit.
#
# DATA_ROOT: base directory containing training data, tokenized data, and
#            tokenizers on this machine. All data paths in the repo are
#            resolved relative to this root.
#
# The repo reads and writes the following subdirectories under DATA_ROOT:
#   monolingual-tokenizers/              Tokenizers (bpe_unscaled_tokenizers/, unigram_unscaled_tokenizers/)
#   monolingual_training_data/           Raw text files (eng_latn.txt, fineweb_eng.txt, ...)
#   monolingual_training_data_bp/        Byte-premium train/eval splits
#   monolingual_training_data_tokenized/ Packed token-id files consumed by the trainer

DATA_ROOT=/path/to/your/data
